#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:340
msgid "The connection was closed by the system"
msgstr "连接已被系统关闭"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:342 AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:348
#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:356 AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1254
msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "未知错误"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:344
msgid "The request timed out"
msgstr "请求超时"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:346
msgid "The operation was denied by the system"
msgstr "操作被系统拒绝"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:496
msgid "Already running!"
msgstr "已经在运行！"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:496
msgid ""
"AudioPlaybackConnector is already running in background.\r\n"
"Check system tray."
msgstr ""
"AudioPlaybackConnector 已经在后台运行。\r\n"
"请查看系统托盘。"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:540
msgid "Unsupported Operating System"
msgstr "不支持的操作系统"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:540
msgid ""
"AudioPlaybackConnector is not supported on this operating system version."
msgstr "此操作系统版本不支持 AudioPlaybackConnector。"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:577 AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1400
msgid "AudioPlaybackConnector"
msgstr ""

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:811 AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1238
msgid "Disconnecting"
msgstr "正在断开连接"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:829 AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1229
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "已连接"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:891
msgid "Reconnecting"
msgstr "正在重新连接"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:898
msgid "Closed by the system (another device was disconnected)"
msgstr "已被系统关闭（断开其他设备所致）"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:965
msgid ""
"All connections will be closed.\n"
"Exit anyway?"
msgstr ""
"所有连接都将关闭。\n"
"仍然要退出吗？"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:970
msgid "Reconnect on next start"
msgstr "下次启动时重新连接"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:973 AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1170
msgid "Exit"
msgstr "退出"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1018
msgid ""
"Windows can only act as a Bluetooth speaker for one connection at a time, so "
"disconnecting any device also drops the others. This is a Windows "
"limitation, not a bug. When this is on, the dropped devices are reconnected "
"automatically after a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Windows 一次只能以一条连接扮演蓝牙音箱，所以断开任何一台设备，其他设备都会跟"
"着断开。这是 Windows 的限制，不是程序的问题。开启这个选项时，被连带中断的设备"
"会在几秒后自动重新连接。"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1086
msgid "Bluetooth Settings"
msgstr "蓝牙设置"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1096
msgid "Run at login"
msgstr "开机时自动启动"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1119
msgid "Show startup notification"
msgstr "显示启动通知"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1144
msgid "Reconnect devices dropped by another disconnect"
msgstr "自动接回被连带中断的设备"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1232 AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1249
msgid "Connecting"
msgstr "正在连接"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1401
msgid "Application has started and is running in the notification area."
msgstr "应用程序已启动，正在通知区域中运行。"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1419
msgid "Other devices have been reconnected"
msgstr "其他设备已自动重新连接"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1420
msgid "Windows drops all Bluetooth audio devices when one is disconnected."
msgstr "在 Windows 上断开任何一台蓝牙音频设备，其他设备都会跟着断开。"

#: AudioPlaybackConnector.cpp:1421
msgid "You can turn this off from the tray menu."
msgstr "可在右键菜单关闭这个行为。"
